    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "At the hotel and documents",
     "texto": [
      "To say you have already booked: «Ik heb een kamer gereserveerd» (I have booked a room). At reception they will ask for your details: «Wat is uw naam?», and you will show your documents: «Hier is mijn paspoort» (Here is my passport). To find your way around the building: «Het ontbijt is beneden» (Breakfast is downstairs). Travel vocabulary: «de reis» (the trip), «het hotel» (the hotel), «de bagage» (the luggage)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
